# Deny the workspace by default. Local deploys use a remote builder, so an
# ignored credential or research artifact must never enter the build context.
**

# Docker needs its selected recipe even though application COPY instructions do
# not. The remaining root files are the complete poller build metadata.
!Dockerfile.poller
!constraints-poller.txt
!pyproject.toml
!README.md

# The wheel contains Python package sources plus the one declared CLI asset.
# BuildKit can traverse these negated globs without admitting other descendants,
# so bytecode, local data, and future credential file types stay denied.
!tradingagents/**/*.py
!cli/**/*.py
!cli/static/welcome.txt
